            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for all</span> <span id="alg1.l9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">input</span> in <span id="alg1.l9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">inputs</span> <span id="alg1.l9.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
               <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">response</span> <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Candidate answers the <span id="alg1.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">input</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
               <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">score</span> <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Judge rates <span id="alg1.l11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">response</span> from 1 (worst) to 5 (best)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
               append (<span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">scenario</span>, <span id="alg1.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">input</span>, <span id="alg1.l12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">score</span>) to <span id="alg1.l12.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">History</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
            
            
               <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <span id="alg1.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">score</span> <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l13.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> |<span id="alg1.l13.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">TestSet</span>| &lt; <math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l13.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
                add <span id="alg1.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">input</span> to <span id="alg1.l14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">TestSet</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
